试试吧！','completed','2026-06-27 08:45:16','2026-06-27 08:45:18','2026-06-27 08:45:16','2026-06-27 08:45:18'),(103,13,'859ea3acc5ff','self_intro',NULL,'B1',3,60.80,75.00,70.00,85.00,69.00,'建议练习用‘I + verb + object + extra detail’结构组织回答（例如：‘I enjoy hiking because it helps me relax — I usually go every weekend.’），同时积累5–10个与爱好、工作、日常活动相关的具体词汇并造句运用。','completed','2026-06-30 20:26:08','2026-06-30 20:30:30','2026-06-30 20:26:08','2026-06-30 20:30:30');
